## 6. Hold the opposite arrow until the blind reverses (v0.9.3 hold mode)
# Each: blind moving, then the opposite arrow held; "held" = key press to last
# key repeat. Reversal times scatter: 4.9, 7.2, 9.0 s, and one 10 s hold
# that hit the send limit.

15:07:25.020 > Hold DOWN 0110: held 4867 ms (135 key repeats), sent 50 steps in 5123 ms, 9146 wake packets
15:09:49.880 > Hold DOWN 0110: held 7230 ms (203 key repeats), sent 73 steps in 7485 ms, 13376 wake packets
