15:10:57.087 > Hold DOWN 0110: held 9027 ms (256 key repeats), sent 90 steps in 9231 ms, 16498 wake packets

## 7. Pairing remove (completes the 2026-11-12 pairing test)
# Morning (v0.9.0, 3 steps rf 50 / ir 170, ~0.68 s): pair 4 remove and
# pair 4 add, LED 2-3 in from the eye: no jog; grp 4 under C1 0E still
# worked. Control: the working remote's setup add / remove / add jogged both
# group-4 shades every time. Afternoon (v0.9.3, shade awake from recent
# commands, a retry where needed): pair 4 add jogged, pair 4 remove jogged,
# then grp 4 up / down under C1 0E got no response. Safety check (15:25):
# with the working remote's ID, grp 4 up and down both worked, so only the
# clone's entry was removed:
#   > id yyyy
#   Remote ID: yy yy (saved in flash)
#   RF group 4 UP: 998 x yy yy 20 08 A1 (300 ms), then 1100 x tail 21 (330 ms)
#   RF group 4 DOWN: 998 x yy yy 20 08 A2 (300 ms), then 1100 x tail 22 (330 ms)
#   # worked

11:35:30.970 > > pair 4 remove
